{"format":"local-vault-ai-portable-chunks-v1","version":1,"chunks":[{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Network Copilot Intent Classification.md::0","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Network Copilot Intent Classification.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"network copilot intent classification network copilot intent classification","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Network Copilot Intent Classification.md","fileName":"Network Copilot Intent Classification.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Network Copilot Intent Classification","heading":"Document","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"2026-09-27 18:30\n\nStatus: #baby\n\nTags: [[Network Copilot Design]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Network Copilot Design","Network Copilot Response Pipeline","ainetworkingcookbook.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Network Copilot Intent Classification.md::1","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Network Copilot Intent Classification.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"network copilot intent classification network copilot intent classification","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Network Copilot Intent Classification.md","fileName":"Network Copilot Intent Classification.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Network Copilot Intent Classification","heading":"Network Copilot Intent Classification","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"Network copilot intent classification maps a user's question to a task category such as configuration, troubleshooting, explanation, or status inquiry. Even a simple keyword method can choose a more relevant prompt structure and determine which context or tool the copilot should use.\n\nClassification should expose uncertainty and allow correction because the same term can appear in several intents. A question that mentions “configure” might ask for an explanation rather than a change. The classified intent guides the [[Network Copilot Response Pipeline]] but should not grant operational authority.","tags":["baby"],"links":["Network Copilot Design","Network Copilot Response Pipeline","ainetworkingcookbook.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Network Copilot Intent Classification.md::2","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Network Copilot Intent Classification.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"network copilot intent classification network copilot intent classification","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Network Copilot Intent Classification.md","fileName":"Network Copilot Intent Classification.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Network Copilot Intent Classification","heading":"References","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"[[ainetworkingcookbook.pdf]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Network Copilot Design","Network Copilot Response Pipeline","ainetworkingcookbook.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""}]}